{"id":252,"gn":"Pokémon Bois Gecko","ft":["Ses plantes de pieds sont couvertes d’épines lui permettant de marcher au mur et au plafond.","Arcko peut grimper aux murs à l’aide de ses pattes. Grâce à sa queue, il est capable de mesurer l’humidité de l’air et de prédire le temps du jour suivant.","Les épines de ses plantes de pieds lui permettent de marcher aux murs et au plafond sans tomber.","Arcko est doté de petits crochets sous les pattes, ce qui lui permet de grimper aux murs. Ce Pokémon attaque en frappant ses ennemis avec son épaisse queue.","Arcko est cool, calme et serein. Il ne panique jamais, quelle que soit la situation. Quand un ennemi plus gros que lui lui lance un regard de défi, ce Pokémon reste stoïque et ne cède pas un centimètre de terrain."],"fv":{"17":0,"18":0,"23":1,"24":2,"25":3,"26":4},"gr":1,"cr":45,"hc":20,"bh":70,"eg":["Monstrueux","Draconique"],"gw":"medium-slow","gm":{"zadlc":[0,39],"svdisk":[0,182],"sv":[2,182],"oras":[0,1],"e":[0,1],"rs":[0,1]},"f":{"252":{"n":"Arcko","t":["grass"],"s":[40,45,35,65,55,70],"h":0.5,"w":5,"a":[[65,0],[84,1]],"pa":[[4,[[65,0]]]],"av":["zadlc","svdisk","sv","oras","e","rs"],"ls":[{"l":[[1,1],[43,1],[670,3],[98,6],[72,9],[197,12],[501,15],[372,18],[202,21],[21,24],[104,27],[412,30],[103,33],[283,36],[437,39]],"m":[9,14,36,67,76,91,97,129,156,157,164,168,182,202,203,214,241,242,263,270,280,283,317,331,332,345,374,402,409,412,437,447,512,520,525,580,784,803,851,885,918],"e":[24,71,73,163,225,235,388,400]},{"l":[[1,1],[43,1],[71,5],[98,9],[72,13],[228,17],[202,21],[97,25],[21,29],[197,33],[412,37],[501,41],[283,45],[103,49]],"m":[14,15,70,76,91,92,104,148,156,157,164,182,207,213,214,216,218,219,237,241,249,263,267,280,290,317,332,374,412,447,496,512,590,612],"e":[13,24,73,225,235,242,283,300,306,320,331,345,363,388,437,580],"t":[9,67,173,202,231,235,264,283,388,402,409,520]},{"l":[[1,1],[43,1],[71,6],[98,11],[228,16],[103,21],[72,26],[97,31],[21,36],[197,41],[202,46]],"m":[15,70,76,91,92,104,148,156,182,202,213,2